- 架构全景见 [`SYSTEM-ARCHITECTURE.md`](SYSTEM-ARCHITECTURE.md)；功能细节见 [`FEATURES.md`](FEATURES.md)；数据怎么流见 [`DATAFLOW.md`](DATAFLOW.md)；开源与依赖见 [`OPEN-SOURCE.md`](OPEN-SOURCE.md)。
